      "Desc": "Attack the target twice with the magic sword. First attack deals Physical DMG equal to 60% / 80% / 100% AP, second attack deals Magic DMG equal to 60% / 80% / 100% AP.<br>",
      "NumericDesc": "Range：1,2<br>Physical ATK DMG：60% / 80% / 100%<br>Magic ATK DMG：60% / 80% / 100%<br>Cooldown：1 turn<br>Sanity Cost：15 / 20 / 25",
      "Story": "Lilith always reminds you: true combat never relies on brute force alone. Every feint lays groundwork for the final blow.<br>\"Watch closely, Guildmaster—this is what a magic blade should look like.\"",
